# playFrame(Int frame)
# Dispatch to the keyframe body for `frame`. MSC has no dynamic
# function lookup, so this is a hand-coded @if chain (see the MSC
# docs, "No dynamic constant lookup"). One branch per keyframe, 0..282.
@using project
@fast

